CONTROL. The node's network config, unchanged: 1 hop, automatic path finding.
Planner settings are the edge-client preset plus whatever the network config sets
in [connection.path_planner] -- on the jura configs, min_paths_anonymity_floor = 3,
which despite its name CAPS the candidate set at 3 (lowest latency kept).
Every other arm is read as a difference from this one.
